{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/e3e3401uloq9ht3tzmkbrwednpxn3uh.mp3","text":"您叫我吗，博士！我很高兴能和博士待在一起！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/in5oj6zxbae6xfbajqv9jtde3yk685e.mp3","text":"博士！凯尔希医生说博士应该更注意健康哦。简单说的话，就是要·减·少·进·食！这样！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/npajs4sgbwspdonfshg3nf9cbha5u3c.mp3","text":"那个，博士，如果我妹妹还是那样态度蛮横，请一定要告诉我哦！那个孩子缺少了我的治疗是绝对不行的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/e5a17z4t22xmm50128dicjrv1qtep7f.mp3","text":"凯尔希老师教我的知识都很有用，虽然也很难学。不过，因为营养学本来就是我最擅长的，所以我觉得自己做的很好哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/3w014va6x10vcl12a3147axuqa5b1d9.mp3","text":"比起刚加入罗德岛时，现在我对大家更放心了！大家也会按时吃掉我的健康食品。只是，为什么吃完之后，大家的表情都变得那么奇怪呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/jpvl4vdaaf2bwof68vq97cjru28aspd.mp3","text":"锵——博士特供健康餐！清咖啡、不加肉类、芝士、酸黄瓜的生菜汉堡！还有，还有用十二种蔬菜混合制成的沙拉哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/edu3kthltxuadq3mjikcqhegnp9b7oq.mp3","text":"那个，博士，您的家人在什么地方呢？他们还好吗？有些事，正因为是亲人才难以沟通，但我觉得也不能因为很难就拒绝沟通，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/dcwax8rl0h5dj1dvv9zrzrgxa0lcyi5.mp3","text":"如果一个人吃饭太寂寞的话，就让我来陪您一起吃吧！对啦，还可以叫上炎熔！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/lv1a40adr5yixajvtk87makko59ne14.mp3","text":"博士，您睡着了吗？那就请好好休息吧，充分的睡眠对健康很有好处。","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/fge8u7ug4j01skawi1yjm6f9dd79ux4.mp3","text":"实习医生芙蓉，今天开始，我会负责您和罗德岛各位干员的健康管理项目，请多多关照！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/opqh0ckmra3e1wqpa6ts67o01h3ju3v.mp3","text":"原来如此原来如此！是这样啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/ia2hpx3nw8mrmmhb5w9hjr8xj9k8wk7.mp3","text":"很荣幸能获得晋升！博士，今后我也会为大家努力进行健康管理，请随时监督我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/eq4o9r53u1peihfbjf1hnfksjc0c25k.mp3","text":"不会让您失望的！就让我来保护大家！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/9grgl36yjv5oy59z6g5pstsu9p7khxf.mp3","text":"我知道了！大家的生命就由我来守护！首先，应该准备好特制缓释秘药......","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/r5m829saspqg0jnuwvn8mnlqeyqpfik.mp3","text":"我不在的时候，博士一定要注意自己的安全！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/m6cv47povric1zvfftsf0h47dwsvady.mp3","text":"准备治疗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/dodqidtjpl9uy08dkp0fy2o2z94lqz7.mp3","text":"别怕！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/3awvr1crtkeh8lu0bpau65j8jtyx5se.mp3","text":"博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/k6sgkb1bly4jv3917el1uiajfbyxd6k.mp3","text":"嘿咻。","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/0otwdoe8m5xglg5sv67psuihx7tvdwq.mp3","text":"这里很安全！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/ojgqs2tcl91xl1of9mdhoqqnz36823k.mp3","text":"请睁开眼睛！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/074p8waaa4cabxg38oomnrzwbi36223.mp3","text":"我能让你的伤口快速愈合！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/p7qnopbzbb5vaxcrr9oesal3ixd68x6.mp3","text":"无论有多少伤员，我都能用这把杖治好大家！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/f0tq11ms2btlpet1p5lxs7q6wi0w8bk.mp3","text":"每个人都平平安安的，就是对我最大的鼓励啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/1kuppa5cgfwivo0pmmcniojofm08k1z.mp3","text":"博士！大家！没有受伤吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/fb8x4u8rkhmwmaxl3kqh5vdy2i7askf.mp3","text":"不对......需要急救！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/blq6z2ngsocy7cske63j0wl5vpaxo38.mp3","text":"有什么需要帮忙的吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/46v3gtlj1qhelvka40cspvuql9usdxs.mp3","text":"啊呀~！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/gr5vvq8eykiub2rssuhsmpo4rp96e3i.mp3","text":"博士，要试一下新的功能饮品吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/49ukvw30e45kvgkco9vjgrmrrxdgb78.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/nj142j4burzqywykhvfdpbvhjpztspj.mp3","text":"博士，新的健康日程表！放心啦放心啦，今天面对这样一桌美味的大餐，我特别准许博士可以吃——一口油炸食物！最多啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/6779n3yss8dg2qxvqe1jatktvgpl71g.mp3","text":"博士，要不要尝尝这个？","alt":"voice_cn/char_120_hibisc/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/dih6ae8slquatafit83gwe4t2cypqsc.mp3","text":"您叫我吗，博士！我很高兴能和博士待在一起！","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/4kkj7hh05x2vx92jjwqyrauzxa1zj8v.mp3","text":"博士！凯尔希医生说博士应该更注意健康哦。简单说的话，就是要·减·少·进·食！这样！","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/6ktam9dyvase4z8o3escb2gzhjvv4af.mp3","text":"那个，博士，如果我妹妹还是那样态度蛮横，请一定要告诉我哦！那个孩子缺少了我的治疗是绝对不行的！","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/h0tiy6pbitfwyx4yabz7lo391vwbfi6.mp3","text":"凯尔希老师教我的知识都很有用，虽然也很难学。不过，因为营养学本来就是我最擅长的，所以我觉得自己做的很好哦。","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/avtwmxe5u7jkmv3le52jzviuul7ie6r.mp3","text":"比起刚加入罗德岛时，现在我对大家更放心了！大家也会按时吃掉我的健康食品。只是，为什么吃完之后，大家的表情都变得那么奇怪呢？","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/7u673tyllohj4lmvz85oj2nxzy9le7f.mp3","text":"锵——博士特供健康餐！清咖啡、不加肉类、芝士、酸黄瓜的生菜汉堡！还有，还有用十二种蔬菜混合制成的沙拉哦！","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/oymsgydnnwlpsfqhfa0vpuds16efldk.mp3","text":"那个，博士，您的家人在什么地方呢？他们还好吗？有些事，正因为是亲人才难以沟通，但我觉得也不能因为很难就拒绝沟通，对吧？","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/qhjukq0i4celegkv9m9svqfjpgnb3zb.mp3","text":"如果一个人吃饭太寂寞的话，就让我来陪您一起吃吧！对啦，还可以叫上炎熔！","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/ssrtutlh4e0yr0tbudtc9d808mc794y.mp3","text":"博士，您睡着了吗？那就请好好休息吧，充分的睡眠对健康很有好处。","alt":"voice/char_120_hibisc/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/4s99fxrepm7wt8ysgkmngpf50uexmby.mp3"